<title>GERMANY: Heidelzement 96 sales, profit higher.</title>
<headline>Heidelzement 96 sales, profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>HEIDELBERG, Germany 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  6,474   vs 6,039</p>
<p>    --cement				     3,304   vs 2,950</p>
<p>    --concrete				   2,035   vs 1,772</p>
<p>    --construction materials		 1,472   vs 1,605</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German cement maker is Heidelberger Zement AG. The company said its group net profit excluding minority interests rose significantly in 1996 compared with 1995. It did not give a figure.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
